# tally 2.2.1 P43 S6 (E §6.3): a window-dated instance's day is its last fulfilling observation's as
# known on the model's on, in every ledger, once (review g2fix led/l1_two_months). A guard: refcore so.
=== l1_two_months.tally
model l1
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st
  cite card
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 60.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_w) "r1"
version st4
  cite card
  governs 2026-04
  known 2026-05-10
  covers konto
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-04-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 40.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_w) "r2"
ask mar: residuals konto 2026-03
ask apr: residuals konto 2026-04
ask both: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
ask mar_k: residuals konto 2026-03 as known 2026-04-15
ask bal_m: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
apr: residuals konto 2026-04
  2026-04 move pay_w: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN
    matched pay_w on 2026-04-02: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-06-20
bal_m: 560.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-20
both: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
  2026-04 move pay_w: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_w on 2026-04-02: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days, -27 days
  cut 2026-06-20
mar: residuals konto 2026-03
  cut 2026-06-20
mar_k: residuals konto 2026-03
  cut 2026-04-15
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of pay_w disagree: bank[r1] (60.00 PLN) and bank[r2] (40.00 PLN)
